      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can image certain graphs making sense to be shown as exponentially values, but draw calls should not be. \n\nThere should be either a toggle or maybe a detection of which would be displayed better. For example, `530` makes a lot more sense than `5.3e2`, `1500` than 1.5e3`.",
